{"page":428,"verses":[{"verse_key":"34:1","surah":34,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" ٱلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ ٱلَّذِى لَهُۥ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَهُ ٱلْحَمْدُ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْحَكِيمُ ٱلْخَبِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Praise be to God, to whom belongs all that is in the heavens and earth, and praise be to Him in the life to come. He is the All Wise, the All Aware.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"All praises","transliteration":"al-ḥamdu","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"(be) to Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"the One to Whom belongs","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"the One to Whom belongs","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"whatever","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and whatever","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَهُ","en_gloss":"and for Him","transliteration":"walahu","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَمْدُ","en_gloss":"(are) all praises","transliteration":"l-ḥamdu","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en_gloss":"(is) the All-Wise","transliteration":"l-ḥakīmu","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْخَبِيرُ","en_gloss":"the All-Aware","transliteration":"l-khabīru","verse_key":"34:1"},{"pos":18,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"34:1"}]},{"verse_key":"34:2","surah":34,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ مَا يَلِجُ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا يَخْرُجُ مِنْهَا وَمَا يَنزِلُ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ وَمَا يَعْرُجُ فِيهَا ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلرَّحِيمُ ٱلْغَفُورُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He knows all that goes into the earth and all that comes out of it; He knows all that comes down from the heavens and all that goes up to them. He is the Merciful, the Forgiving.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"He knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَلِجُ","en_gloss":"penetrates","transliteration":"yaliju","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَخْرُجُ","en_gloss":"comes out","transliteration":"yakhruju","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَنزِلُ","en_gloss":"descends","transliteration":"yanzilu","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَعْرُجُ","en_gloss":"ascends","transliteration":"yaʿruju","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِيهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","en_gloss":"(is) the Most Merciful","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْغَفُورُ","en_gloss":"the Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"l-ghafūru","verse_key":"34:2"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"34:2"}]},{"verse_key":"34:3","surah":34,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ لَا تَأْتِينَا ٱلسَّاعَةُ ۖ قُلْ بَلَىٰ وَرَبِّى لَتَأْتِيَنَّكُمْ عَـٰلِمِ ٱلْغَيْبِ ۖ لَا يَعْزُبُ عَنْهُ مِثْقَالُ ذَرَّةٍ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَلَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَآ أَصْغَرُ مِن ذَٰلِكَ وَلَآ أَكْبَرُ إِلَّا فِى كِتَـٰبٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Still, the disbelievers say, ‘The Last Hour will never come upon us.’ Say, ‘Yes, by my Lord, [it will], by Him who knows the unseen! Not even the weight of a speck of dust in the heavens or earth escapes His knowledge, nor anything smaller or greater. It is all recorded in a clear Record","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"But say","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تَأْتِينَا","en_gloss":"will come to us","transliteration":"tatīnā","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿatu","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"balā","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَرَبِّى","en_gloss":"by my Lord","transliteration":"warabbī","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَتَأْتِيَنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"surely it will come to you","transliteration":"latatiyannakum","verse_key":"34:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَـٰلِمِ","en_gloss":"(He is the) Knower","transl