n_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"34:3"}]},{"verse_key":"34:4","surah":34,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"لِّيَجْزِىَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُم مَّغْفِرَةٌ وَرِزْقٌ كَرِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"so that He can reward those who believe and do good deeds: they will have forgiveness and generous provision.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لِّيَجْزِىَ","en_gloss":"That He may reward","transliteration":"liyajziya","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ ۚ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those ","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(will be) forgiveness","transliteration":"maghfiratun","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَرِزْقٌۭ","en_gloss":"and a provision","transliteration":"wariz'qun","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَرِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"noble","transliteration":"karīmun","verse_key":"34:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٤","en_gloss":"(4)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"34:4"}]},{"verse_key":"34:5","surah":34,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ سَعَوْ فِىٓ ءَايَـٰتِنَا مُعَـٰجِزِينَ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ مِّن رِّجْزٍ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But as for those who work against Our Revelations, seeking to undermine them, there will be a torment of painful suffering.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"But those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"34:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَعَوْ","en_gloss":"strive","transliteration":"saʿaw","verse_key":"34:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"